    your day going?"},"_position":{"x":99.91956,"y":1106.904},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"21"},{"availableChoices":[{"statement":{"_text":"Good,
    how about you?"}},{"statement":{"_text":"Not Great, im worried."}}],"_position":{"x":99.98212,"y":1249.606},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNode","$id":"22"},{"statement":{"_text":"Doing
    good,  was just was at  [RandLocExcludeHotel]. Great people thereI"},"_position":{"x":-34.9216,"y":1455.406},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"23"},{"statement":{"_text":"Oh
    im sure it can''t be that bad, at least not as bad as"},"_position":{"x":189.1077,"y":1453.139},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"24"},{"statement":{"_text":"That
    wacko that escaped jail after murder! Work of the devil I say."},"_position":{"x":185.7056,"y":1527.986},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"25"},{"statement":{"_text":"He
    does''t even speek, just steals everyone''s stuff. "},"_position":{"x":193.644,"y":1615.308},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"26"},{"statement":{"_text":"Mabye
    you can give him something and he''ll say something actually usefull."},"_position":{"x":185.7056,"y":1686.753},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"27"},{"statement":{"_text":"The
    [RandLoc] is wonderfull to visit"},"_position":{"x":412.6534,"y":1120.999},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"28"},{"availableChoices":[{"statement":{"_text":"What
    makes it so great?"}},{"statement":{"_text":"Thats awsome, I''ll be sure to visit"}}],"_position":{"x":418.5668,"y":1785.485},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNode","$id":"29"},{"statement":{"_text":"Well
    my friend [randPersonName] visits there quite often,"},"_position":{"x":293.616,"y":1946.831},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"30"},{"statement":{"_text":"That
    reminds me, that Photographer was there recently"},"_position":{"x":290.9491,"y":2036.172},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"31"},{"statement":{"_text":"You
    should ask her to take photos of places to know whats going on around town."},"_position":{"x":297.6163,"y":2118.844},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"32"},{"statement":{"_text":"Yeah,
    It would be great to have more people there."},"_position":{"x":531.7184,"y":1940.239},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"33"},{"statement":{"_text":"I
    was at [RandLoc] earlier, seems different place"},"_position":{"x":776.3245,"y":1120.546},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"34"},{"availableChoices":[{"statement":{"_text":"Different
    in what way?"}},{"statement":{"_text":"Best not to go there anymore I suppose"}}],"_position":{"x":730.6945,"y":1293.337},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNode","$id":"35"},{"statement":{"_text":"Mabye
    it was that creepy lady who dresses in all black."},"_position":{"x":639.973,"y":1482.34},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"36"},{"statement":{"_text":"She
    creeps me out man, I''d stay away from her If I was you, she knows some things..."},"_position":{"x":636.949,"y":1563.99},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"37"},{"statement":{"_text":"Ah
    but I loved how it felt before, Well thanks anyway."},"_position":{"x":883.4091,"y":1486.876},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"38"},{"statement":{"_text":"I
    heard some people talking about [RandLoc] earlier. Wonder what that was about? 
    \r\n"},"_position":{"x":1076.942,"y":1141.549},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"39"},{"availableChoices":[{"statement":{"_text":"Do
    you know who?"}},{"statement":{"_text":"What was discussed?"}}],"_position":{"x":1115.48,"y":1665.34},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNode","$id":"40"},{"statement":{"_text":"Hmm..
    I think it was [randPersonName]?"},"_position":{"x":945.6185,"y":1849.21},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"41"},{"statement":{"_text":"I''m
    not sure..."},"_position":{"x":984.1439,"y":1928.012},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"42"},{"statement":{"_text":"People
    talk crazy here all the time, its like there''s something evil here"},"_position":{"x":954.3744,"y":2008.564},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"43"},{"statement":{"_text":"Or
    someone."},"_position":{"x":970.1348,"y":2085.615},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"44"},{"childOptions":[{"weight":{"_value":1.0}},{"weight":{"_value":1.0}},{"weight":{"_value":1.0}},{"weight":{"_value":1.0}}],"_position":{"x":1315.11,"y":1847.459},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.ProbabilitySelector","$id":"45"},{"statement":{"_text":"The
    sherriff was snooping around there lately"},"_position":{"x":1182.023,"y":2132.896},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"46"},{"statement":{"_text":"Some
    recent renovations planned at [RandLocExcludeHotel]."},"_position":{"x":1185.526,"y":1973.542},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"47"},{"statement":{"_text":"Hah,
    they were just gossiping about [randPersonName]"},"_position":{"x":1194.281,"y":2045.338},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"48"},{"statement":{"_text":"Hmm.."},"_position":{"x":1222.3,"y":2216.951},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"49"},{"statement":{"_text":"I
    forgot."},"_position":{"x":1336.124,"y":2225.707},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"50"},{"statement":{"_text":"I
    was in my friend [randPersonName]''s room the other day. Lovely time we had. 
    \r\n"},"_position":{"x":1371.746,"y":1135.538},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"51"},{"availableChoices":[{"statement":{"_text":"Mabye
    next time I can join you guys in the fun."}},{"statement":{"_text":"What did
    you guys do?"}}],"_position":{"x":1381.651,"y":1264.211},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNode","$id":"52"},{"statement":{"_text":"Sure
    we would love to have you there."},"_position":{"x":1292.413,"y":1426.911},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"53"},{"statement":{"_text":"We
    used a little bit of that devils lettuce!"},"_position":{"x":1510.314,"y":1428.119},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"54"},{"statement":{"_text":"Sh...
    don''t tell the sherrif or he''ll suspect us of bein evil!"},"_position":{"x":1515.696,"y":1503.162},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"55"},{"statement":{"_text":"Whats
    up?  \r\n"},"_position":{"x":1804.338,"y":1137.743},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"56"},{"availableChoices":[{"statement":{"_text":"Nothing
    much"}},{"statement":{"_text":"Alot I suppose."}}],"_position":{"x":1778.979,"y":1625.398},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNode","$id":"57"},{"statement":{"_text":"Well
    then hold on to your secrets mister."},"_position":{"x":1627.531,"y":1783.245},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"58"},{"statement":{"_text":"Seems
    like everyone here has some secrets..."},"_position":{"x":1623.265,"y":1870.701},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"59"},{"statement":{"_text":"Same
    here, I''ve been worried about [randPersonName] lately."},"_position":{"x":1900.564,"y":1785.379},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNode","$id":"60"}],"connections":[{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"0"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"1"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"1"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"2"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"2"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"3"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"2"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"8"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"3"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"4"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"3"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"5"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"3"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"6"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"3"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"7"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"8"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"9"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"8"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"21"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"8"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"28"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"8"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"34"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"8"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"39"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"8"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"51"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"8"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"56"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"9"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"10"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"10"},"_targetNode":{"$ref":"11"},"$type":"NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.DTConnection"},{"_sourceNode":{"$ref":"10"},"_targetNode":{